      "text": "BREAKING: Oklahoma Senator Alan Armstrong, the former CEO of Williams Companies, $WMB,  just disclosed selling up to $28.4 million worth of Williams stock, $WMB.\n\nThe sale took place on June 24, but wasn't disclosed until July 21.\n\nThe disclosure was part of a filing containing 703 trades totaling over $10 million in reported volume, with 701 filed well beyond the STOCK Act's 45-day deadline.\n\nThe penalty? \n\n$200.",
